/* iOS「設定」App 裡 S2Arm 頁（Root.plist）的繁體中文：鍵是 Root.plist 裡的英文原文（#316），與 zh-Hans.lproj/Root.strings 一一對應 */
"Phone as Controller (When No Controller Is Connected)" = "手機當手把（未連接外接手把時）";
"Gyro: tilt the phone for Switch handheld motion controls (such as tilt aiming in Splatoon); the sensor only runs when the game needs motion. Rumble: game rumble plays through the phone’s motor. A connected controller takes over automatically." = "陀螺儀：傾斜手機來模擬 Switch 手提模式的體感操作（例如斯普拉遁的傾斜瞄準），只在遊戲需要體感時才啟用感測器。震動：遊戲的手把震動改由手機馬達輸出。連接外接手把後會自動改用手把。";
"Phone Gyro" = "手機陀螺儀";
"Phone Haptics" = "手機震動";
"Switch Mode (Restart the Game to Apply)" = "Switch 模式（變更後需重新啟動遊戲）";
"Docked mode is how the Switch runs in its dock; when off, Handheld mode is used. The actual resolution and quality are up to the game; this is set separately from the compatible / high-performance run mode. Takes effect on next launch." = "TV 模式對應 Switch 接上底座時的模式，關閉時使用手提模式。實際解析度和畫質由遊戲決定；與相容 / 高效能執行模式分開設定。下次啟動時生效。";
"Docked Mode" = "TV 模式";
"Graphics (Restart the Game to Apply)" = "畫面（變更後需重新啟動遊戲）";
"Scales relative to the game’s current render size and keeps widescreen. A lower scale reduces graphics load; a higher scale improves sharpness but uses more power and memory. Some textures are still processed at the game’s original size." = "以遊戲目前的渲染尺寸為基準縮放，保留現有寬螢幕。降低倍率可減輕圖形負載；提高倍率可改善清晰度，但也會增加耗電量和記憶體用量。部分材質仍會以遊戲原始尺寸處理。";
"Render Resolution Scale" = "渲染解析度倍率";
"1× (Native)" = "1×（原生）";
"Reduces jagged edges in the final game picture; may also soften text and detail. Off still keeps the game’s own anti-aliasing." = "減少最終遊戲畫面的鋸齒，也可能讓文字和細節變得較柔和。關閉後仍會保留遊戲本身的反鋸齒。";
"Anti-Aliasing" = "反鋸齒";
"Off" = "關閉";
"SMAA Medium" = "SMAA 中";
"SMAA High" = "SMAA 高";
"Used to scale the game picture to the screen; doesn’t change the internal render resolution." = "用來將遊戲畫面縮放到螢幕大小，不會改變內部渲染解析度。";
"Scaling Filter" = "畫面縮放濾鏡";
"Bilinear (Smooth)" = "雙線性（平滑）";
"Nearest Neighbor (Crisp Pixels)" = "最近鄰（像素清晰）";
"Sets a frame rate cap for the game picture; doesn’t unlock the game’s own frame rate limit. The actual frame rate also depends on the game and the screen’s refresh rate." = "設定遊戲畫面的幀率上限，不會解除遊戲本身的幀率限制。實際幀率也取決於遊戲表現和螢幕更新率。";
"Frame Rate Limit" = "幀率上限";
"30 FPS" = "30 幀/秒";
"60 FPS" = "60 幀/秒";
"120 FPS" = "120 幀/秒";
"Unlimited" = "不限";
"Controller" = "手把";
"When on, you can connect a Switch 2 Pro Controller in game and use its buttons, HD rumble and motion controls. Hold the SYNC button on top of the controller to connect. This setting applies only to this app." = "開啟後可在遊戲中連接 Switch 2 Pro 手把，使用按鍵、HD 震動和體感操作。連接時需長按手把頂部的 SYNC 鍵。此設定只對本 App 生效。";
"Enable Switch 2 Pro Controller Support" = "啟用 Switch 2 Pro 手把支援";
"Sound" = "聲音";
"When on, game sound keeps playing while the iPhone is in Silent Mode. When off, S2Arm follows Silent Mode like other games. Takes effect when you switch back to the app." = "開啟後，iPhone 處於靜音模式時遊戲仍會發出聲音；關閉時和其他遊戲一樣跟隨靜音模式。切回 App 後立即生效。";
"Play Sound in Silent Mode" = "靜音模式下也播放聲音";
"Saves" = "存檔";
"Save in the game first, then close and reopen the app. Save management opens before the game starts, where you can export a backup or import a .s2asave file from a Mac. Your current save is kept before restoring. The switch turns off once the game starts." = "請先在遊戲內儲存，再關閉並重新開啟 App。存檔管理會在遊戲啟動前開啟，可匯出備份或匯入 Mac 的 .s2asave 檔案。回復前會保留原本的存檔。開始遊戲後開關會自動關閉。";
"Manage Saves on Next Open" = "下次開啟時管理存檔";
"Diagnostics" = "診斷";
"Turn this on and switch back to the game: S2Arm packs the logs from the last few runs into a diagnostics bundle and opens the share sheet (AirDrop, Save to Files, WeChat). The bundle contains no saves, keys or game files. The switch turns off after export. You can also export in game by holding four fingers on the screen for 1.5 seconds." = "開啟這個開關後切回遊戲，S2Arm 會把最近幾次執行的紀錄打包成診斷包，並開啟分享面板（AirDrop、儲存到「檔案」、微信）。診斷包不含存檔、金鑰和遊戲檔案。匯出後開關會自動關閉。在遊戲中用四指同時長按螢幕 1.5 秒也能匯出。";
"Export Diagnostics When the App Opens" = "開啟 App 時匯出診斷包";
"Development" = "開發";
"The S2Arm diagnostics overlay shows the target frame rate, slow-frame ratio, graphics path, first-use compilation, audio and build ID. Metal HUD shows the frame rate, GPU time and a frame-interval graph, for manual viewing only; while it’s on, screenshots, frame capture, autoplay and full-screen checks are unavailable. Takes effect the next time the app starts. Metal HUD is for apps you build and install on a development device yourself." = "S2Arm 診斷浮層會顯示目標幀率、慢幀比例、圖形路徑、首次編譯、音訊和包號。Metal HUD 顯示幀率、GPU 時間和幀間隔曲線，僅供手動觀察；開啟時無法使用截圖、存幀、自動玩家和全螢幕判定。設定會在下次啟動 App 時生效。Metal HUD 適用於自行組建並安裝到開發裝置的 App。";
"S2Arm Diagnostics Overlay" = "S2Arm 診斷浮層";
"About This Build (Read-Only)" = "關於本包（唯讀）";
"Fixed when the package was built and can’t be changed: graphics mode, direct library version and build time." = "出包時就已決定，無法更改：畫面模式、直連庫版本、出包時間。";
"Graphics Mode" = "畫面模式";
"Direct Library Version" = "直連庫版本";
"Build Time (UTC)" = "出包時間（UTC）";
"Build ID" = "包號";
"Metal HUD" = "Metal HUD";
"Unknown (shown after opening a game once)" = "未知（開啟一次遊戲後顯示）";
"Screen Layout" = "螢幕配置";
"Applies to every game. Automatic split screen enables only when partially folded; without hinge status it stays off. Automatic orientation uses portrait for split screen and landscape otherwise. Some games need a restart to apply widescreen to the new area." = "所有遊戲共用。自動分割畫面只在裝置半摺疊時開啟；無法讀取摺疊狀態時維持關閉。自動方向在分割畫面時使用直向，否則使用橫向。部分遊戲需要重新啟動後，才會依新區域套用寬螢幕比例。";
"Split Screen" = "上下分割畫面";
"Screen Orientation" = "螢幕方向";
"Automatic" = "自動";
"On" = "開啟";
"Landscape" = "橫向";
"Portrait" = "直向";
